{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"映射谱"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"映射谱"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>映射谱是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Sp","text":"$\\mathsf{Sp}$"}},{"Plain":" 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"闭范畴","text":"闭"}},{"Plain":"对称幺半范畴结构的一部分.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>作为右伴随</h3>\n<p>对"},{"Local":{"url":"谱","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":" $X\\in\\mathsf{Sp}$, 由 $X$ 出发的映射谱函子 $[X,-]\\colon\\mathsf{Sp}\\to\\mathsf{Sp}$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"压缩积","text":"压缩积"}},{"Plain":" (张量积) 函子 $X\\wedge -\\colon \\mathsf{Sp} \\to \\mathsf{Sp}$ 的右"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}